{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02404","headline":"听邻人琵琶 · 陈叔达","name":"听邻人琵琶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本是龙门桐，因妍入汉宫。\n香缘罗袖里，声逐朱弦中。\n虽有相思韵，翻将入塞同。\n关山临却月，花蘂散回风。\n爲将金谷引，添令曲未终。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈叔达","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}